   "he": "אָמַר רַבִּי יְהוּדָה אֵימָתַי. אָמַר רַבִּי אֲבָהוּ אָמַר רַבִּי אֶלְעָזָר: הֲלָכָה כְּרַבִּי יְהוּדָה.",
   "en": "§ The mishna teaches that «Rabbi Yehuda says: When» are all these people, e.g., gamblers and those who lend with interest, disqualified from bearing witness? It is when they have no occupation other than this one. «Rabbi Abbahu says» that «Rabbi Elazar says: The halakha» is «in accordance with» the opinion of «Rabbi Yehuda.»"
  }
